  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Special munitions are expensive.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Munitions as a chosen triggerman specialization</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you make an attack using a firearm shooting special ammunition produced by a munitions technique and miss, if that firearm also has a loaded barrel containing standard ammunition, you may retroactively consume a unit of ammunition from the loaded standard ammunition and retain your unit of special ammunition with which you missed. This ability may be used three times per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/triggerman-feats#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
